---
description: Do not leave a file changed only by formatting or reordering
alwaysApply: true
---

# Substantive edits only

Modify a file only when the change is substantive. A file whose diff is only formatting is not allowed.

Formatting includes whitespace, line wrapping, and rearranging the same lines, such as import or module order.

When an edit deletes lines, check the diff that remains. If what remains is only formatting or reordering, restore the file.
